      "title": "Database operations",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Combined read + write DB operation rate. Each side is aggregated with sum() before adding, because the two counters carry disjoint `operation` label values and a bare vector `+` would match nothing.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(registry_write_operations_total{service=~\"$service\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])) + sum(rate(registry_read_operations_total{service=~\"$service\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "ops/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Operation Rate",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "App errors = registry_errors_total (application error counter, all error_types). DB errors = registry_db_errors_total (database connection failures only). App errors has no series until the counter is first incremented, so it is guarded with `or vector(0)` and reads 0.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "vertical",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(registry_errors_total{service=~\"$service\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "App errors",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(registry_db_errors_total{service=~\"$service\", instance=~\"$instance\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "DB errors",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Error Rate",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "p95 of registry_write_latency (milliseconds). Buckets are aggregated with sum by (le) so the quantile stays correct if a second replica is ever scraped. Registry traffic is sparse — a 5m rate window is undefined (NaN) in ~75% of windows — so the quantile is computed over a 1h window and spanNulls bridges the rest.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 100
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 500
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
